// App Store edition. There is only one edition today — unlike Distavo (Direct /
// App Store / Setapp), Tankmate iOS ships through the App Store only, so there
// is no third-party updater and no edition flag to keep apart.
//
// The web payload is stripped of the Lemon Squeezy "Buy me a coffee" checkout at
// build time (scripts/prepare-web-bundle.py). App Review Guideline 3.1.1 forbids
// steering users to an outside payment flow; the link is REMOVED from the
// bundled HTML, not merely hidden, and the script fails the build if any trace
// of it survives.
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = uk.co.riera.tankmate

// Push notifications are stubbed but OFF. Switching them on needs all three of:
//   1. the Push Notifications capability on the App ID in the Developer portal,
//   2. a provisioning profile regenerated with that capability,
//   3. the two lines below uncommented.
// Enabling the entitlement before (1) and (2) makes signing fail.
// CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = Tankmate-Push.entitlements
// SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = REMOTE_PUSH_ENABLED
